# (uint8 + quant_state keys). The brianmatzelle repo ships its own patched
# moshi package (mounted at /models/ppx/moshi) with auto-detecting
# pre-quantized loading (_load_prequantized_weights, loaders.py:383) and a
# --quantize-4bit flag. Two shadowing traps to defeat so `import moshi`
# resolves to it: (1) the fork's EDITABLE install (.pth meta-path finder) ->
